Package: adaptiveFTS
Title: Adaptive Functional Time Series Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hassan", "Maissoro", , "maissorohassan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
  Adaptive estimation procedures for weakly dependent functional time series,
  following Maissoro, Patilea and Vimond (2025) <doi:10.1111/jtsa.70006>.
  Provides estimators for the local regularity parameters, the mean function and
  the autocovariance function, together with an adaptive estimator of the Best
  Linear Unbiased Predictor (BLUP) for prediction.
